      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うーん、どうかしら。\r\nみんな、それぞれだと思うけど。",
        "official_en": "Ohh... I wouldn’t be so sure. Doubtless, some of them seek vengeance after all that’s happened, but others may have chosen to walk their own paths.",
        "real_en": "Hmm, I don't know. I think it's different for each of them."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
