        "official_en_sha256": "5208d537332be3ccd12f14d925cfc10106fa3f9ab558095506c667afc273d526"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうなるの。\r\nビジョンが使えるのだからな。",
        "official_en": "That you are, I presume, given your talent for summoning forth visions.",
        "real_en": "That's right. You can use Visions, after all."
      },
