        "jp": "そのパラデイアの血が\r\n長い年月をかけてこの世界の人々に\r\n混じっていったのじゃ。",
        "official_en": "This power, held in their blood, was passed down to the people of this land with the passage of years.",
        "real_en": "Over the years, Paladian blood mixed with that of the people of this world."
      },
