        "official_en_sha256": "5a7039599dd703a52368952125bee891cda8a124ffdaf23c44b03183020794cd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ソルって……精神世界で会ったあいつか。\r\n命は何より尊いって言ってたっけ。\r\nなんかいい奴そうだったな。",
        "official_en": "Sol... That’s the guy we met in Fina’s psyche. I remember he said, “Life is too precious a currency to be spent so recklessly.” Seemed like a good person.",
        "real_en": "Sol... The guy we met in Fina's mind. He said life was more precious than anything else. He seemed like a good guy."
      },
