      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "元々住んでいた者との間で、\r\n諍いが生まれたこともあったが、\r\n最終的に共存する道を選んだ。",
        "official_en": "Dispute ensued between the people of Paladia and the denizens of this land. But ultimately, most—if not all—of the Paladians chose instead to coexist with the natives of Lapis.",
        "real_en": "There were conflicts with the people already living here, but in the end we chose to coexist."
      },
